  "abstract": "Covers the OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS) with its MAS project companions, the Mobile Application Security Weakness Enumeration (MASWE) and the Mobile Application Security Testing Guide (MASTG), for reviewing and hardening iOS and Android apps. It lists three families: MASVS 2.1 (current, v2.1.0) and MASVS 1.5 (legacy), MASTG 2.0 (current, v2.0.0) and MASTG 1.7 (legacy), and MASWE 1.0 (current, v1.0.0) and the MASWE beta numbering (legacy). SKILL.md holds the invariants and assessment workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, the 24 controls with their MASWE weaknesses, MAS testing profiles and the testing process, and the MASVS 1.x to 2.x requirement mapping.",
